<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Akses Terbatas | Tokyo Denki Library</title>
    
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.10.5/font/bootstrap-icons.css">

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            /* Background gelap biar elegan */
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8)), url('WhatsApp Image 2026-02-26 at 3.15.16 PM.jpeg') center/cover no-repeat;
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .restricted-card {
            background-color: #1a202c; /* Biru sangat gelap */
            border: 2px solid #d35400; /* Garis oranye dop */
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
            padding: 50px 40px;
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 450px;
            width: 90%;
            animation: fadeIn 0.5s ease-in-out;
        }

        .icon-lock {
            font-size: 5rem;
            color: #d35400;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .btn-oranye { 
            background-color: #d35400; 
            color: white; 
            font-weight: bold; 
            border: none; 
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        .btn-oranye:hover { 
            background-color: #ba4a00; 
            color: white; 
        }

        .btn-outline-oranye { 
            border: 2px solid #d35400; 
            color: #d35400; 
            font-weight: bold; 
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .btn-outline-oranye:hover { 
            background-color: #d35400; 
            color: white; 
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-20px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="restricted-card">
        <i class="bi bi-shield-lock-fill icon-lock"></i>
        <h2 class="text-white fw-bold mb-3">Akses Eksklusif!</h2>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1;" class="mb-4">
            Waduh, lu belum login nih! Halaman ini khusus buat anggota resmi Perpustakaan Tokyo Denki. Yuk, login dulu buat nikmatin semua fiturnya.
        </p>
        
        <div class="d-grid gap-3">
            <a href="login.html" class="btn btn-oranye">LOGIN SEKARANG</a>
            <a href="daftar.html" class="btn btn-outline-oranye">BELUM PUNYA AKUN? DAFTAR</a>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>